{"type":"standard","title":"Kabutra language","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Kabutra language</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q10966761","titles":{"canonical":"Kabutra_language","normalized":"Kabutra language","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Kabutra language</span></span>"},"pageid":35705219,"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1333526208","tid":"82efdbf6-f44a-11f0-abc6-1bcbececf921","timestamp":"2026-01-18T08:48:51Z","description":"Indo-Aryan language of Sindh, Pakistan","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kabutra_language","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kabutra_language?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kabutra_language?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Kabutra_language"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kabutra_language","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Kabutra_language","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kabutra_language?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Kabutra_language"}},"extract":"Kabutra is an endangered Indo-Aryan language spoken in Sindh, Pakistan. Kabutra is almost identical to neighboring Sansi in India. Kabutra is unwritten, but may be written with a variety of the Arabic script.","extract_html":"<p><b>Kabutra</b> is an endangered Indo-Aryan language spoken in Sindh, Pakistan. Kabutra is almost identical to neighboring Sansi in India. Kabutra is unwritten, but may be written with a variety of the Arabic script.</p>"}